<title>USA: NetVantage to redeem Class B warrants.</title>
<headline>NetVantage to redeem Class B warrants.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetVantage Inc Wednesday said it set January 10, 1997 as the redemption date for its Class B warrants .</p>
<p>Each Class B Warrant entitles the holder to purchase, at an exercise price of $7.41 per share.</p>
<p>All Class B Warrants not exercised prior to the redemption date will be redeemed by the company for $0.05 each. No fractional shares will be issued.  </p>
<p>Each Class B Warrant entitles the holder to purchase, at an exercise price of $7.41 per share, 1.05 shares of common A.</p>
</text>
